MODULE: ElapsedTimeNeverExpiresDeferral
TARGET: StreamProgresses
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: elapsed time cannot reach the timeout despite retries in a stable lifetime
PERTURBS: Elapse
BOUNDS: Records = 2, Cap = 2

--- FIND
    /\ age' = [r \in Ids |-> IF age[r] \in 0..(Timeout - 1) THEN age[r] + 1 ELSE age[r]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ age' = age
--- END
